cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the original paper for the scientific ideas and findings. Also identify
  the repository commit or release when using this independent implementation.
  See REFERENCES.bib for the GAP model, dataset, and SPC method.
title: "Amorphous graphite: an independent Python reimplementation"
type: software
repository-code: https://github.com/regmi-sijan/amorphous-graphite-reimplementation
authors:
  - name: "Independent amorphous graphite reimplementation contributors"
abstract: >-
  An independent Python-led workflow inspired by Thapa et al. (2022), combining
  GAP molecular dynamics, structural analysis, periodic PySCF electronic
  calculations, and broadened Kubo-Greenwood/SPC analysis. Small software tests
  have completed; a full quantitative reproduction has not been established.
keywords:
  - amorphous graphite
  - molecular dynamics
  - reproducibility
  - density functional theory
  - electronic transport
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "Ab Initio Simulation of Amorphous Graphite"
